 # Mina the Hollower (`0100DCD01F306000`)
 
-Update 1.0.5 (v262144), SDK 21.4.3, Yacht Club Games' own engine on NVN. Modules `main` and `sdk`. Everything in the RomFS is a `.yc` file in Yacht Club's YCD archive format, uncompressed; the 114 shaders (110 keys) are in `shaders.pak.yc`. Only this update is registered in the profile.
+Update 1.0.5 (v262144), SDK 21.4.3, Yacht Club Games' own engine on NVN. Modules `main` and `sdk`. Everything in the RomFS is a `.yc` file in Yacht Club's YCD archive format, uncompressed; the 114 shaders (110 keys) are in `shaders.pak.yc`. Updates 1.0.5 (v262144) and 1.0.6 (v327680) are registered, each by its `main` build ID. The profile's shader tables, prewarm list and measurements are 1.0.5's (`package v262144`): a 1.0.6 build derives its own tables, see [Shaders](#shaders).
 
